    -- HC.jl already does Skeel row scaling internally; column scaling is the gap
    -- biohydrogenation / daisy_mamil4 diagnostics show cond(J) of 1e6 to 1e10 at low noise
    -- design notes + three implementation levels in docs/2026-05-01_variable_scaling_investigation.md
