research: rebuild UQ around derivative-estimator covariance rather than GP posterior covariance
    -- current UQ in src/core/uncertainty_quantification.jl is an experimental sidecar
    -- likely wrong object for coverage: SE GP posterior derivative covariance is
       not the sampling covariance of the derivative estimator used by ODEPE
    -- preferred target: z_hat = W y, Cov(z_hat) = W Sigma_y W', then
       Cov(theta_hat) approx S Cov(z_hat) S' with S = -F_theta^{-1} F_z
    -- validate by repeated-noise coverage before using in papers/user docs
    -- detailed research note: docs/2026-05-24_uq_research_todo.md

